# Yarr safety

## Read-only default

Search, status, sessions, and queue inspection via yarr MCP are fine when media
work is authorized. Do **not**:

- delete movie/series files or library items
- purge / force-recheck torrents in bulk
- change quality profiles or root folders

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the title or id.

## Site overlays

Library classification and path overlays stay in private `homelab` — do not
hard-code site paths in this portable plugin.
